---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Haftalık SuperTrend Taraması"
  description="BIST hisselerinde önceki tamamlanmış haftalık mumda SuperTrend AL sinyali oluşan hisseleri tarayın."
>
  <div class="scanner-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/araclar/">← Araçlar</a>

    <header class="scanner-header">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">BIST · HAFTALIK</p>
        <h1>Haftalık SuperTrend Taraması</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Güncel haftalık mumu dışarıda bırakır; yalnızca bir önceki haftalık mumda
          satış trendinden alış trendine dönen hisseleri bulur ve önceki 12 haftayı tarihleriyle gösterir.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="parameter-card" aria-label="Tarama ayarları">
        <span>ATR</span><strong>10</strong>
        <span>Çarpan</span><strong>3,0</strong>
        <span>Kaynak</span><strong>HL2</strong>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="scan-panel" aria-labelledby="scan-title">
      <div class="scan-copy">
        <h2 id="scan-title">Önceki haftanın AL sinyallerini bul</h2>
        <p>Tarama bütün BIST şirketlerini kapsar. Sonuçlar hisse koduna göre sıralanır.</p>
      </div>
      <button id="scan-button" class="scan-button" type="button">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <path d="M4 18V9m5 9V5m5 13v-7m5 7V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
        <span>Taramayı Başlat</span>
      </button>

      <div id="scan-status" class="scan-status" hidden aria-live="polite">
        <div class="status-line">
          <span id="status-text">Tarama verileri yükleniyor…</span>
          <strong id="status-percent">0%</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true">
          <div id="progress-bar" class="progress-bar"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="error-panel" class="message-panel error-panel" hidden role="alert">
      <strong>Tarama şu anda tamamlanamadı.</strong>
      <p id="error-message">Lütfen kısa bir süre sonra yeniden deneyin.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="results" class="results" hidden aria-labelledby="results-title">
      <div class="results-heading">
        <div>
          <p id="target-week" class="eyebrow"></p>
          <h2 id="results-title">AL sinyali veren hisseler</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="result-count"><strong id="signal-count">0</strong><span>hisse</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="summary-grid">
        <div><span>Taranan</span><strong id="scanned-count">—</strong></div>
        <div><span>Atlanan</span><strong id="failed-count">—</strong></div>
        <div><span>Veri zamanı</span><strong id="generated-at">—</strong></div>
      </div>

      <div id="empty-result" class="empty-result" hidden>
        <div class="empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
        <h3>Bu hafta yeni AL sinyali yok</h3>
        <p>Belirlenen haftada SuperTrend satıştan alışa dönen bir BIST hissesi bulunmadı.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="table-wrap" class="table-wrap" hidden>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Hisse</th>
              <th>Şirket</th>
              <th>Sektör</th>
              <th class="numeric">Haftalık kapanış</th>
              <th class="numeric">SuperTrend</th>
              <th>Sinyal</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="result-body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="history-results" class="history-results" hidden aria-labelledby="history-title">
      <div class="history-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">SON 12 HAFTA</p>
          <h2 id="history-title">Geçmiş haftaların AL sinyalleri</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Her tarih, taramanın yapıldığı pazartesiyi; altındaki tarih ise değerlendirilen cuma kapanışını gösterir.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="history-list" class="history-list"></div>
    </section>

    <aside class="method-note">
      <strong>Nasıl çalışır?</strong>
      <p>
        Günlük fiyatlar cuma kapanışlı haftalık mumlara çevrilir. Pine Script'teki
        SuperTrend (ATR 10, çarpan 3) hesabı uygulanır ve güncel hafta değerlendirme dışı bırakılır.
        Fiyatlar bölünme ve nakit temettülere göre düzeltilir; eksik şirket işlemleri otomatik onarılır.
        Güncel sonuçla birlikte önceki 12 haftanın sinyalleri tutulur. Piyasa verisi her pazartesi
        otomatik yenilendiğinde tarih listesi de bir hafta ileri kayar.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <p class="legal-note">
      Veriler Yahoo Finance üzerinden alınır ve yalnızca bilgi amaçlıdır; yatırım tavsiyesi değildir.
      Ayrıntılar için <a href="/yasal-uyari/">Yasal Uyarı</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .scanner-page { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 3.5rem; }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .scanner-header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 2rem; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 0.45rem; color: var(--warm-accent); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 0.65rem; font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.65rem); line-height: 1.15; }
  .intro { max-width: 680px; margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .parameter-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto auto; gap: 0.45rem 1.25rem; min-width: 180px; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--bg-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .parameter-card span { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .parameter-card strong { text-align: right; color: var(--text); }
  .scan-panel { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.045); }
  .scan-copy h2 { margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .scan-copy p { margin: 0 0 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .scan-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem; min-height: 46px; padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font: 600 0.92rem var(--font-body); cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.15s, background 0.15s, opacity 0.15s; }
  .scan-button:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .scan-button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .scan-button:disabled { cursor: wait; opacity: 0.7; transform: none; }
  .scan-button.is-loading svg { animation: pulse-bars 0.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes pulse-bars { to { opacity: 0.35; } }
  .scan-status { margin-top: 1.15rem; }
  .status-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .status-line strong { color: var(--text); }
  .progress-track { height: 7px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bg-secondary); }
  .progress-bar { width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--warm-accent)); transition: width 0.12s ease; }
  .message-panel { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 9px; }
  .message-panel p { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .error-panel { border: 1px solid #ef4444; background: color-mix(in srgb, #ef4444 8%, var(--card-bg)); color: var(--text); }
  .results { margin-top: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--card-bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .results-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem 1rem; }
  .results-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .result-count { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.35rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .result-count strong { color: #15803d; font-size: 1.85rem; line-height: 1; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .result-count strong { color: #4ade80; }
  .summary-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-secondary); }
  .summary-grid div { padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .summary-grid div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .summary-grid span { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.74rem; }
  .summary-grid strong { font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.86rem; }
  th, td { padding: 0.8rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; }
  th { color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-secondary); font-size: 0.73rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 4%, transparent); }
  .numeric { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ticker-cell { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: 0.025em; }
  .company-cell { max-width: 280px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .signal-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem; border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, #22c55e 13%, transparent); color: #15803d; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .signal-badge { color: #4ade80; }
  .signal-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }
  .empty-result { padding: 2.75rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .empty-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; margin: 0 auto 0.8rem; border-radius: 50%; background: color-mix(in srgb, #22c55e 13%, transparent); color: #15803d; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .empty-result h3 { margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .empty-result p { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .history-results { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .history-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
  .history-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .history-heading p:last-child { max-width: 520px; margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .history-list { display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; }
  .history-week { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(190px, 0.42fr) 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--card-bg); }
  .history-date strong { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .history-date span { display: block; margin-top: 0.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.76rem; }
  .history-signals { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; }
  .history-ticker { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.58rem; border-radius: 7px; background: color-mix(in srgb, #22c55e 11%, var(--bg-secondary)); color: #15803d; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .history-ticker { color: #4ade80; }
  .history-empty { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .method-note { margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--warm-accent); background: var(--bg-secondary); color: var(--text); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .method-note p { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .legal-note { margin: 1rem 0 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .scanner-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .parameter-card { width: 100%; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; align-items: center; }
    .scan-button { width: 100%; }
    .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .summary-grid div { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .summary-grid div:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
    .summary-grid div:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-bottom: 0; }
    .results-heading { align-items: flex-end; }
    .history-heading { display: block; }
    .history-heading p:last-child { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    .history-week { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.65rem; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  interface ScanStock {
    ticker: string;
    name: string;
    sector: string;
    close: number;
    supertrend: number;
    buy_signal: boolean;
  }

  interface HistoryWeek {
    scan_date: string;
    week_end: string;
    signal_count: number;
    stocks: ScanStock[];
  }

  interface ScanData {
    ready: boolean;
    message?: string;
    target_week_end: string;
    generated_at: string;
    scanned: number;
    total_tickers: number;
    failed?: number;
    stocks: ScanStock[];
    history?: HistoryWeek[];
  }

  const dataUrl = '/data/bist-weekly-supertrend.json';
  const button = document.querySelector('#scan-button');
  const buttonLabel = button?.querySelector('span');
  const status = document.querySelector('#scan-status');
  const statusText = document.querySelector('#status-text');
  const statusPercent = document.querySelector('#status-percent');
  const progressBar = document.querySelector('#progress-bar');
  const errorPanel = document.querySelector('#error-panel');
  const errorMessage = document.querySelector('#error-message');
  const results = document.querySelector('#results');
  const tableWrap = document.querySelector('#table-wrap');
  const emptyResult = document.querySelector('#empty-result');
  const resultBody = document.querySelector('#result-body');
  const historyResults = document.querySelector('#history-results');
  const historyList = document.querySelector('#history-list');

  const setProgress = (current: number, total: number, label: string) => {
    const percent = total > 0 ? Math.round((current / total) * 100) : 0;
    if (statusText) statusText.textContent = label;
    if (statusPercent) statusPercent.textContent = `${percent}%`;
    if (progressBar instanceof HTMLElement) progressBar.style.width = `${percent}%`;
  };

  const formatDate = (value: string, includeTime = false) => {
    if (!value) return '—';
    const options: Intl.DateTimeFormatOptions = includeTime
      ? { dateStyle: 'medium', timeStyle: 'short' }
      : { day: '2-digit', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' };
    return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('tr-TR', options).format(new Date(value));
  };

  const formatPrice = (value: number) =>
    new Intl.NumberFormat('tr-TR', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 }).format(value) + ' ₺';

  const renderHistory = (history: HistoryWeek[]) => {
    if (!historyList) return;
    historyList.innerHTML = '';
    for (const week of history.slice(0, 12)) {
      const article = document.createElement('article');
      article.className = 'history-week';

      const dateBlock = document.createElement('div');
      dateBlock.className = 'history-date';
      const scanDate = document.createElement('strong');
      scanDate.textContent = formatDate(week.scan_date);
      const weekEnd = document.createElement('span');
      weekEnd.textContent = `${formatDate(week.week_end)} kapanışı`;
      dateBlock.append(scanDate, weekEnd);

      const signals = document.createElement('div');
      signals.className = 'history-signals';
      if (!Array.isArray(week.stocks) || week.stocks.length === 0) {
        const empty = document.createElement('span');
        empty.className = 'history-empty';
        empty.textContent = 'Yeni AL sinyali yok';
        signals.appendChild(empty);
      } else {
        for (const stock of week.stocks) {
          const ticker = document.createElement('span');
          ticker.className = 'history-ticker';
          ticker.textContent = stock.ticker;
          ticker.title = stock.name || stock.ticker;
          signals.appendChild(ticker);
        }
      }
      article.append(dateBlock, signals);
      historyList.appendChild(article);
    }
    if (historyResults instanceof HTMLElement) historyResults.hidden = history.length === 0;
  };

  const renderResults = (data: ScanData, signals: ScanStock[]) => {
    const targetWeek = document.querySelector('#target-week');
    const signalCount = document.querySelector('#signal-count');
    const scannedCount = document.querySelector('#scanned-count');
    const failedCount = document.querySelector('#failed-count');
    const generatedAt = document.querySelector('#generated-at');

    if (targetWeek) targetWeek.textContent = `${formatDate(data.target_week_end)} haftası`;
    if (signalCount) signalCount.textContent = String(signals.length);
    if (scannedCount) scannedCount.textContent = `${data.scanned} / ${data.total_tickers}`;
    if (failedCount) failedCount.textContent = String(data.failed ?? 0);
    if (generatedAt) generatedAt.textContent = formatDate(data.generated_at, true);

    if (resultBody) {
      resultBody.innerHTML = '';
      for (const stock of signals) {
        const row = document.createElement('tr');
        const values = [
          { text: stock.ticker, className: 'ticker-cell' },
          { text: stock.name || '—', className: 'company-cell' },
          { text: stock.sector || '—' },
          { text: formatPrice(stock.close), className: 'numeric' },
          { text: formatPrice(stock.supertrend), className: 'numeric' },
        ];
        for (const value of values) {
          const cell = document.createElement('td');
          cell.textContent = value.text;
          if (value.className) cell.className = value.className;
          row.appendChild(cell);
        }
        const signalCell = document.createElement('td');
        const badge = document.createElement('span');
        badge.className = 'signal-badge';
        badge.innerHTML = '<span class="signal-dot"></span> AL';
        signalCell.appendChild(badge);
        row.appendChild(signalCell);
        resultBody.appendChild(row);
      }
    }

    if (tableWrap instanceof HTMLElement) tableWrap.hidden = signals.length === 0;
    if (emptyResult instanceof HTMLElement) emptyResult.hidden = signals.length !== 0;
    if (results instanceof HTMLElement) results.hidden = false;
    renderHistory(Array.isArray(data.history) ? data.history : []);
    results?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
  };

  button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!(button instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
    button.disabled = true;
    button.classList.add('is-loading');
    if (buttonLabel) buttonLabel.textContent = 'Taranıyor…';
    if (status instanceof HTMLElement) status.hidden = false;
    if (errorPanel instanceof HTMLElement) errorPanel.hidden = true;
    if (results instanceof HTMLElement) results.hidden = true;
    if (historyResults instanceof HTMLElement) historyResults.hidden = true;
    setProgress(0, 1, 'Haftalık tarama verileri yükleniyor…');

    try {
      const response = await fetch(`${dataUrl}?t=${Date.now()}`, { cache: 'no-store' });
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Tarama verisi indirilemedi.');
      const data = await response.json() as ScanData;
      if (!data.ready || !Array.isArray(data.stocks)) {
        throw new Error(data.message || 'İlk haftalık tarama henüz hazırlanmadı.');
      }

      const signals: ScanStock[] = [];
      const total = data.stocks.length;
      const chunkSize = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(total / 24));
      for (let index = 0; index < total; index += chunkSize) {
        const chunk = data.stocks.slice(index, index + chunkSize);
        signals.push(...chunk.filter((stock) => stock.buy_signal));
        const current = Math.min(index + chunk.length, total);
        setProgress(current, total, `${current} / ${total} hisse tarandı`);
        await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 28));
      }

      signals.sort((a, b) => a.ticker.localeCompare(b.ticker, 'tr'));
      renderResults(data, signals);
      if (buttonLabel) buttonLabel.textContent = 'Yeniden Tara';
    } catch (error) {
      if (errorMessage) errorMessage.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Lütfen kısa bir süre sonra yeniden deneyin.';
      if (errorPanel instanceof HTMLElement) errorPanel.hidden = false;
      if (buttonLabel) buttonLabel.textContent = 'Tekrar Dene';
      setProgress(0, 1, 'Tarama tamamlanamadı');
    } finally {
      button.disabled = false;
      button.classList.remove('is-loading');
    }
  });
</script>
